    <textTemplates>
        <name>SS_CLF_Escalated</name>
        <isViewedAsPlainText>false</isViewedAsPlainText>
        <text>&lt;p&gt;Hello {!Salutation_Value}&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Your Closed Loop Feedback Case {!RecordLink} is now Escalated.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;What should you do next?&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;1) Review the full response by logging in to Qualtrics -&amp;gt; Feedback Page on the Dashboard (search by email or case#)&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;Parent Case Number: {!$Record.Parent.CaseNumber}&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;Account Name: {!$Record.Account.Name}&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;Contact Name: {!$Record.Contact.FirstName} {!$Record.Contact.LastName}&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;Email: {!$Record.ContactEmail}&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;Likelihood to Recommend Score: {!$Record.Qualtrics_Response__r.LTR__c}&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;# of Contact attempts to resolve the issue: {!$Record.Qualtrics_Response__r.Contact_attempts_before_resolution__c}&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;Main Comment: {!$Record.Qualtrics_Response__r.Main_Comment__c}&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;2) Follow up with the customer regarding their feedback ASAP but respecting their business hours. Use a combination of calls and emails to improve your outreach success.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;3) Document closing-the-loop outcomes and reasons for detraction.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Thank you!&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Sincerely,&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;RingCentral Voice of the Customer Team&lt;/p&gt;</text>
    </textTemplates>
